---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Terms of Service" description="BhaktiMedia.in — Terms of Service.">
<div class="container-x px-4 pb-20 pt-32 sm:px-6">
  <header class="max-w-3xl">
    <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 font-display text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">Terms of <span class="text-gradient">Service</span></h1>
    <p class="mt-2 font-dev text-sm text-golden/80">॥ नियमाः सेवायाः ॥</p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-sandal-deep/60 dark:text-cream/50">Last updated: 23 September 2026</p>
  </header>

  <div class="mt-10 max-w-3xl space-y-10 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-sandal-deep/80 dark:text-cream/75">
    <section>
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-sandal-deep dark:text-cream">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
      <p class="mt-3">BhaktiMedia.in ("we", "us", "our") operates a digital devotional creative studio. By accessing or using our website, AI Studio, poster generation, or any related services, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree, please do not use the service.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-sandal-deep dark:text-cream">2. Our Services</h2>
      <p class="mt-3">We provide:</p>
      <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-6">
        <li>AI-powered devotional image and poster generation</li>
        <li>Festival-themed poster templates and customization</li>
        <li>AI video generation and editing services</li>
        <li>Voiceovers (Marathi, Hindi, Sanskrit, English)</li>
        <li>Social media marketing, website design, and temple branding</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-3">All AI-generated content is provided as-is based on the prompts and templates you provide.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-sandal-deep dark:text-cream">3. Payments & Subscriptions</h2>
      <p class="mt-3">Payments are processed securely through <b>Razorpay</b>. By subscribing to a plan or purchasing credits, you confirm that the payment method belongs to you and has sufficient funds. All prices are in INR inclusive of applicable taxes unless stated otherwise. Subscription plans auto-renew unless cancelled before the renewal date.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-sandal-deep dark:text-cream">4. User Conduct</h2>
      <p class="mt-3">You agree <b>NOT</b> to use our services to:</p>
      <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-6">
        <li>Generate content that disrespects any deity, religion, community, or individual</li>
        <li>Create hateful, obscene, defamatory, or illegal content</li>
        <li>Violate any third-party intellectual property rights</li>
        <li>Attempt to reverse-engineer, scrape, or abuse the AI Studio</li>
        <li>Impersonate any person or entity</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-3">Violation may result in immediate account termination without refund.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-sandal-deep dark:text-cream">5. Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p class="mt-3">All website design, templates, branding, shlokas, and original content remain the property of BhaktiMedia. AI-generated outputs created through your prompts and uploaded photos are licensed to you for personal and commercial use, subject to the platform's AI provider policies.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-sandal-deep dark:text-cream">6. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p class="mt-3">To the maximum extent permitted by Indian law, BhaktiMedia shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from use of the service, including but not limited to loss of data, revenue, or reputation. Our total liability is limited to the amount you paid us in the 12 months preceding the claim.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-sandal-deep dark:text-cream">7. Account Termination</h2>
      <p class="mt-3">We reserve the right to suspend or terminate accounts that violate these terms, misuse the service, or remain inactive beyond 12 months. You may delete your account anytime from the dashboard.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-sandal-deep dark:text-cream">8. Governing Law & Disputes</h2>
      <p class="mt-3">These Terms are governed by the laws of India. Any disputes shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of courts in <b>Pune, Maharashtra</b>. We encourage resolving disputes amicably — reach out to us first before any legal action.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-sandal-deep dark:text-cream">9. Changes to These Terms</h2>
      <p class="mt-3">We may update these terms occasionally. Material changes will be communicated via email or dashboard notice. Continued use after changes constitutes acceptance.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-sandal-deep dark:text-cream">10. Contact</h2>
      <p class="mt-3">Questions about these terms? <a href="/contact" class="font-semibold text-saffron hover:underline">Contact us</a> — we reply within 24 hours.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>
</Layout>